egins, pitting the favored candidate, Hayama Akira, against Nakiri Erina's aide, Arato Hisako!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-07-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wGPNQszTRKT15yQgacS8CA9nVXN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wGPNQszTRKT15yQgacS8CA9nVXN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62273/season/2/episode/3"},{"id":"1203397","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The 4th round between Takumi Aldini and Mimasaka Subaru unexpectedly becomes a shokugeki. Takumi's bruised pride ignites his desire to beat Mimasaka, but Mimasaka starts making the exact same dish as Takumi…","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-07-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dhHb8GzFKJ6dEeVu7TopwbH7s2C.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dhHb8GzFKJ6dEeVu7TopwbH7s2C.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62273/season/2/episode/4"},{"id":"1203399","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Not only will Yukihira face Mimasaka in the semi-finals, but the match will also be a shokugeki! Yukihira even tells Mimasaka what he'll prepare for the match--how does he plan to defeat Mimasaka's perfect profiling?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-07-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uFbRMdCddfhLpHeoun4eb2AAcAR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uFbRMdCddfhLpHeoun4eb2AAcAR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62273/season/2/episode/5"},{"id":"1211033","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"ov